<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DRAGONAIR SO cute, but I ain’t got\none. You got a DRAGONAIR㊛?\rTrade it for my DODRIO? It got three\nheads, so it’s like three homies. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SHEESH! Good looks!\nI ALWAYS wanted a DRAGONAIR!\fI’m namin’ it Princess.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That ain’t a DRAGONAIR㊛.\nTrade with me if you get one.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You don’t wanna trade?\nOh, DANG... DODRIO was hype for it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How that DODRIO doin’? It still argue\nwith itself?\rYour DRAGONAIR SO cute! Princess say\nhi!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You came through the window,\ndidn’t you? I see the mud.\rOh?\nYour {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It been workin’ SO hard, ain’t it?\rAs a reward, give it the Effort\nRibbon. It’s like a participation\ftrophy but earned.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} got\nthe Effort Ribbon.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} put the Effort Ribbon\non {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It need to grind a lil harder.\rIf it do, I’ll give it somethin’ nice.\nRight now it’s givin’ lazy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s grindin’ a lil, I see.\rBut it need MORE effort! Hustle!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s grindin’, I see.\rBut it need just a lil\nmore effort!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s grindin’ real hard, I see.\rBut it need a tiny bit\nmore effort!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s grindin’ SO hard, I see.\rIt’s ALMOST there.\nJust a smidge more and BOOM!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0634_T30R0301_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! That Effort Ribbon look\ngood on your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}!</language>
	</row>
</body>
